                      "translation": "The road of his journey to the Eastern provinces took him.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1314,
                      "phraseID": "7",
                      "startTime": 1296,
                      "transcription": "Ise ya Owari no umizura ni tatsu nami made mo ",
                      "translation": "Even at Ise and Owari the waves on the sea rise and return!",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1322,
                      "phraseID": "8",
                      "startTime": 1314,
                      "transcription": "kaeru koto yo to urayami",
                      "translation": "With envy he wondered always, ",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1333,
                      "phraseID": "9",
                      "startTime": 1322,
                      "transcription": "itsu ka warera mo kaeru nami no",
                      "translation": "when he too might find himslef, with foam-drenched sleeves",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1354,
                      "phraseID": "10",
                      "startTime": 1333,
                      "transcription": "koromode ni arama shi to omoi-tsuzukete-yuku hodo ni.",
                      "translation": "returning home, even as he continued on his way.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1372,
                      "phraseID": "11",
                      "startTime": 1354,
                      "transcription": "[SHITE] Koko ya kashiko no tatakai ni",
                      "translation": "[SHITE] In the battles in one place and in the next ",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1383,
                      "phraseID": "12",
                      "startTime": 1372,
                      "transcription": "[JIUTAI] Jin-ba gankutsu ni mi wo kudaki,",
                      "translation": "[JIUTAI] Men and horses: their bodies crushed in their caverns,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1395,
                      "phraseID": "13",
                      "startTime": 1383,
                      "transcription": "Chi wa takuroku no kawa to natte,",
                      "translation": "their blood on the battlefields a river,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1408,
                      "phraseID": "14",
                      "startTime": 1395,
                      "transcription": "kōha tate nagashi sudo ni oyoberu Ebisu mo.",
                      "translation": "their shields swept away on crimson waves again and again.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1415,
                      "phraseID": "15",
                      "startTime": 1408,
                      "transcription": "kabuto wo nuide hoko wo fuse",
                      "translation": "Finally the barbarians removed their helmets,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1427,
                      "phraseID": "16",
                      "startTime": 1415,
                      "transcription": "mina kōsan wo mōshikeri.",
                      "translation": "lay down their arms and were made to surrender.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1450,
                      "phraseID": "17",
                      "startTime": 1427,
                      "transcription": "Mi-koto no gyō yori mi-kariba wo susume tamaeri.",
                      "translation": "From the time of this Prince's reign, the royal sport of hunting was begun.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1470,
                      "phraseID": "18",
                      "startTime": 1464,
                      "transcription": "Koro wa Kami-na-zuki,",
                      "translation": "It was an incident that occurred, ",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1479,
                      "phraseID": "19",
                      "startTime": 1470,
                      "transcription": "hatsu ka amari no koto nareba.",
                      "translation": "on the twentieth day of the Tenth month:",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1488,
                      "phraseID": "20",
                      "startTime": 1479,
                      "transcription": "Yo-mo no momiji mo fuyugare no",
                      "translation": "Everywhere the autumn tints had faded,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1498,
                      "phraseID": "21",
                      "startTime": 1488,
                      "transcription": "tō-yama ni miyuru hatsu-yuki wo,",
                      "translation": "and even on the distant winter withered mountains,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1510,
                      "phraseID": "22",
                      "startTime": 1498,
                      "transcription": "nagame sase tamaishi ni,",
                      "translation": "the traces of the first snow fall could be seen.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1524,
                      "phraseID": "23",
                      "startTime": 1510,
                      "transcription": "[SHITE] Yebisu shi-hō wo kakomitsutsu.",
                      "translation": "[SHITE] The barbarians surrounding him on every side",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1534,
                      "phraseID": "24",
                      "startTime": 1524,
                      "transcription": "[JIUTAI] Kare-no no kusa ni hi wo kake",
                      "translation": "[JIUTAI] Set fire to the grass of the withered fields, and as the blaze burned high",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1544,
                      "phraseID": "25",
                      "startTime": 1534,
                      "transcription": "yo-en shikiri ni moe-kitari",
                      "translation": "and as the blaze burned high with heavy lingering billows of smoke.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1557,
                      "phraseID": "26",
                      "startTime": 1544,
                      "transcription": "kataki-seme-tsuzumi wo uchi-kakete ",
                      "translation": "Began to beat their war drums in the signal to attack.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1572,
                      "phraseID": "27",
                      "startTime": 1557,
                      "transcription": "ka-en wo hanachite kakarikareba.",
                      "translation": "The Towering flames! as the attack blazed forward",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1582,
                      "phraseID": "28",
                      "startTime": 1572,
                      "transcription": "[SHITE] Mi-koto tsurugi wo nuite...",
                      "translation": "[SHITE] The Prince drew his sword",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1588,
                      "phraseID": "29",
                      "startTime": 1582,
                      "transcription": "[JIUTAI] Mi-koto tsurugi wo nuite,",
                      "translation": "[JIUTAI] The Prince drawing his sword,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1597,
                      "phraseID": "30",
                      "startTime": 1588,
                      "transcription": "atari wo harai tachimachi.",
                      "translation": "wielded it about him.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1604,
                      "phraseID": "31",
                      "startTime": 1597,
                      "transcription": "ni honō mo tachi-shirizoke to,",
                      "translation": "At once, the flames drew back,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1614,
                      "phraseID": "32",
                      "startTime": 1604,
                      "transcription": "shi-hō no kusa wo nagi-haraeba.",
                      "translation": "as it mowed down the grasses in all directions.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1624,
                      "phraseID": "33",
                      "startTime": 1614,
                      "transcription": "Tsurugi no seirei arashi to natte,",
                      "translation": "The spirit of the sword became a storm",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1631,
                      "phraseID": "34",
                      "startTime": 1624,
                      "transcription": "hon wo mo kusa mo fuki-kaesarete.",
                      "translation": "blasting back the raging flames and grasses too.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1635,
                      "phraseID": "35",
                      "startTime": 1631,
                      "transcription": "Ten ni kakayaki chi ni michite.",
                      "translation": "The blaze lit up the heavens, covered the earth!",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1642,
                      "phraseID": "36",
                      "startTime": 1635,
                      "transcription": "Myō-ka wa kaette kataki wo yakeba.",
                      "translation": "A furnace of fierce flames turned back to devour the enemy forces.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1647,
                      "phraseID": "37",
                      "startTime": 1642,
                      "transcription": "Su man gi no Yebisu-domo wa,",
                      "translation": "Thus, the countless barbarians,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1656,
                      "phraseID": "38",
                      "startTime": 1647,
                      "transcription": "tachimachi koko nite usetengeri.",
                      "translation": "and cavalrymen were brought down.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1668,
                      "phraseID": "39",
                      "startTime": 1656,
                      "transcription": "Sono nochi shi-kai osamarite,",
                      "translation": "So in later years the Empire was at peace:",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 2756,
                      "phraseID": "40",
                      "startTime": 1668,
                      "transcription": "Jin-ka to-zashi wo wasureshi mo.",
                      "translation": "So much so that the people forgot to bar the doors of their houses.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1685,
                      "phraseID": "41",
                      "startTime": 2756,
                      "transcription": "Sono Kusanagi no yue to ka ya.",
                      "translation": "This is because of the 'Grass-cutter', it was said.",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1697,
                      "phraseID": "42",
                      "startTime": 1685,
                      "transcription": "Tadaima nanji ga utsubeki",
                      "translation": "And now, this auspicious omened blade",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1703,
                      "phraseID": "43",
                      "startTime": 1697,
                      "transcription": "kono zuisō no mitsurugi mo.",
                      "translation": "that you must forge!",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1710,
                      "phraseID": "44",
                      "startTime": 1703,
                      "transcription": "Ika de sore ni wa otorubeki.",
                      "translation": "Is there any reason it should be a lesser blade than that ?",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1723,
                      "phraseID": "45",
                      "startTime": 1710,
                      "transcription": "Tsutōru ie no Munechika yo,",
                      "translation": "Munechika, heir to a house of proud tradition,",
                    },
                    {
                      "endTime": 1746,
                      "phraseID": "46",
                      "startTime": 1723,
                      "transcription": "kokoro yasuku mo omoite ge-kō shi tamae.",
                      "translation": "set your heart at rest and go home now.",
                    },
                  ]
                }
                setCurrentPhrase={[Function]}
                singingStyle=""
